                                "target_word": "exclusive",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ba2081ca-b6af-369f-bd37-6fc5d456780f",
                                        "entry_id": "d342f21d-59a1-33bc-8d6b-9b2099a556e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Excluding items or members that do not meet certain conditions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "literally"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "871e9d03-762c-3d6a-ab9d-5ac1b2cad10e",
                                        "entry_id": "d342f21d-59a1-33bc-8d6b-9b2099a556e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Referring to a membership organisation, service or product: of high quality and/or renown, for superior members only. A snobbish usage, suggesting that members who do not meet requirements, which may be financial, of social status, religion, skin colour etc., are excluded."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "03d52829-c99e-445f-924d-594e71072267",
                                                "sense_id": "871e9d03-762c-3d6a-ab9d-5ac1b2cad10e",
                                                "text": "Exclusive clubs tend to serve exclusive brands of food and drinks, in the same exorbitant price range, such as the 'finest' French châteaux."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "449c85c9-6961-3599-b7f1-b0cfe69822cc",
                                        "entry_id": "d342f21d-59a1-33bc-8d6b-9b2099a556e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exclusionary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "745eac6c-bf5e-3fe7-bbe9-fdd819e81dba",
                                        "entry_id": "d342f21d-59a1-33bc-8d6b-9b2099a556e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Whole, undivided, entire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "35bb35f5-bcd4-47e8-9904-239da5d61b46",
                                                "sense_id": "745eac6c-bf5e-3fe7-bbe9-fdd819e81dba",
                                                "text": "The teacher's pet commands the teacher's exclusive attention."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e2c332ec-6934-3fc1-870b-efc4b6969a31",
                                        "entry_id": "d342f21d-59a1-33bc-8d6b-9b2099a556e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Of or relating to the first-person plural pronoun when excluding the person being addressed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7797060-8603-4ba2-ade4-9d1854015dec",
                                                "sense_id": "e2c332ec-6934-3fc1-870b-efc4b6969a31",
                                                "text": "The pronoun in \"We're going to a party later, but you aren't invited\" is an exclusive \"we\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cb201a4c-2265-31f5-8479-fa41cea8d91d",
                                        "entry_id": "d342f21d-59a1-33bc-8d6b-9b2099a556e8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having a romantic or sexual relationship with one another, to the exclusion of others."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "of two people in a romantic or sexual relationship"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f57e535-728d-4ced-9927-68fe0023db56",
                                                "sense_id": "cb201a4c-2265-31f5-8479-fa41cea8d91d",
                                                "text": "They decided to no longer be exclusive."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "exclusive",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ff15dff-b112-3936-b24f-8408025462ef",
                                        "entry_id": "86b15e43-9bb4-3a4c-9e0c-d94dc3328cb0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Information (or an artefact) that is granted or obtained exclusively."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26b5154b-44e6-49c0-bbeb-2bd7f94480a4",
                                                "sense_id": "4ff15dff-b112-3936-b24f-8408025462ef",
                                                "text": "The editor agreed to keep a lid on a potentially disastrous political scoop in exchange for an exclusive of a happier nature."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8ff06836-de59-3c8d-8e61-80318ff0de31",
                                        "entry_id": "86b15e43-9bb4-3a4c-9e0c-d94dc3328cb0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A member of a group who excludes others from their society."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b6db54e-5001-4de3-b574-a001bea74ac1",
                                                "sense_id": "8ff06836-de59-3c8d-8e61-80318ff0de31",
                                                "text": "The exclusives at the English Universities apply the term CAD to all non-members."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "790f7689-f6a0-3d52-815e-8edd6a251908",
                                        "entry_id": "86b15e43-9bb4-3a4c-9e0c-d94dc3328cb0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A word or phrase that restricts something, such as only, solely, or simply."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "109a438c-0fc3-4357-8621-998992a1a146",
                        "source_entry_id": "10df8a7f-1329-3a77-9382-fc11e4598c7c",
                        "source_sense_id": "9e12978d-0509-3707-be73-45d34a460bd1",
                        "source_sense_description": "wat andere mogelijkheden uitsluit",
                        "target_lang_word": "exclusif",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "exclusif",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8beb1faf-7586-306c-9141-30950ec70309",
                                        "entry_id": "60c92061-279c-3629-86e9-ce911fe13403",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui a force d’exclure."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "164da7fe-5d91-45a0-bb00-7601180efa6c",
                                                "sense_id": "8beb1faf-7586-306c-9141-30950ec70309",
                                                "text": "Tout indivisaire a tout d'abord un droit individuel et exclusif sur sa quote-part."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b54f5093-181c-45a7-a9b3-56a55e84a199",
                                                "sense_id": "8beb1faf-7586-306c-9141-30950ec70309",
                                                "text": "Alliant tradition et modernité, la phytothérapie n'est exclusive d'aucune autre thérapeutique. Elle connaît des précautions d'emploi, des contre-indications, des interactions et, nous l'avons vu, un professionnel de la santé est le mieux placé pour la conseiller à chacun, selon ses besoins."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7ce76c3c-2cb4-4efc-a16d-8ad2e5535ddc",
                                                "sense_id": "8beb1faf-7586-306c-9141-30950ec70309",
                                                "text": "Bill Gates, dont le père est associé fondateur d’un grand cabinet d’avocats de Seattle, propose à IBM un contrat qui prévoit que l’utilisation de MS-DOS ne sera pas exclusive, ce qui lui donne le droit de le vendre à d’autres entreprises informatiques."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "079371bb-b5c6-3f51-9767-a3f761b12254",
                                        "entry_id": "60c92061-279c-3629-86e9-ce911fe13403",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relatif à une exclusivité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c15f7f86-2ea6-4a7e-81ec-e0a672540b6e",
                                                "sense_id": "079371bb-b5c6-3f51-9767-a3f761b12254",
                                                "text": "De toutes les caves, les plus exclusives et spectaculaires sont les fameuses crayères gallo-romaines de Reims.\nElles furent creusées par les Romains qui eurent recours à la craie du sous-sol champenois pour bâtir la ville de Reims, alors appelée Durocortorum."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cd62e16f-5e7a-3006-9c6a-d928350cebe4",
                                        "entry_id": "60c92061-279c-3629-86e9-ce911fe13403",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Qui exclut, qui repousse tout ce qui blesse ses goûts, ses opinions, ses intérêts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e0be8d26-0062-48ec-8b9a-91b943acaf9c",
                                                "sense_id": "cd62e16f-5e7a-3006-9c6a-d928350cebe4",
                                                "text": "Mais que pouvait-on attendre d’un astronome si absorbé […] ? Ce savant exclusif ne vivait que dans la contemplation des phénomènes célestes, […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "942f369b-325b-3aa0-8a33-2696711029dd",
                                        "entry_id": "60c92061-279c-3629-86e9-ce911fe13403",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Se dit d’un pronom personnel de la première personne plurielle qui n’inclut pas l’interlocuteur. En français hexagonal, nous peut être soit inclusif soit exclusif, tandis que nous autres est toujours exclusif."
